    342 U00f6							; BANK 0 — gravity, collision and mission state.
    343 U00f6							; Thursday's Child 0.7B uses the commercial 32K F4 map. Every reset entry
    344 U00f6							; selects fixed engine Bank 7; Bank 7 calls this physics bank through $FFF4.
    345 U00f6							; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
