   1784  08b6							; The Chapter One score is an eight-phrase A-minor/F/C/G composition lasting
   1785  08b6							; about thirty-four seconds. Channel 0 alone performs each main note, its
   1786  08b6							; silence, the lower-octave ghost, and a longer rest in sequence. Channel 1 is
   1787  08b6							; silent during music and reserved exclusively for gameplay sound effects.
