    333  1222							; Eight 4/4 bars at 21 NTSC frames per eighth note: 85.7 BPM, effectively the
    334  1222							; requested 86 BPM. Channel 0 plays a breathing mid-register arpeggio while
    335  1222							; Channel 1 adds two quiet low supports per bar. Both voices include silence
    336  1222							; between attacks, and the divider range avoids the TIA's abrasive extremes.
