    410  1293							; A - E - D - Bm - Em - F#m - G - B. Coarse TIA tuning makes a few thirds
    411  1293							; approximate, so the voicings emphasize clean roots and fifths while still
    412  1293							; distinguishing the minor chords. All lead dividers stay between 10 and 25.
